      "title": "2027 mass nominations",
      "summary": "On September 23, the board set recruiting plans for the 2027 mass nominations: applications are due November 11th, members will staff county fair shifts, and two will recruit at the senior fair on November 21st at the Cameron Center. The chair said 77 seats exist, with 64 open after removing members eligible for reappointment. On September 9, the board voted to form one small group (TIG) to interview, score and recommend applicants.",
